_description:\nThe target video is in a stylized live-action workplace short-drama comedy style with bright office lighting, shallow depth of field, and a subtle handheld feel. The framing stays intimate throughout: medium shots, close-ups, and extreme close-ups only, with no wide shots.\n[Shot 1] A medium shot frames a tidy office desk. <Subject 1>, 李永 (Li Yong) from <Picture 1> with the exact face, hairstyle, clothing, and proportions of the reference image, stands in front of the desk facing <Subject 2>, 旭旭宝宝 (Xu Xu Bao Bao) from <Picture 2> with the exact appearance of the reference image, who leans back in his office chair. 李永 speaks with a careful, hopeful tone (S1): <d>[Chinese] 宝哥，我明天想请个假，回趟老家。</d> 旭旭宝宝 sets down his pen, straightens up, and replies with a serious face (S2): <d>[Chinese] 不行，公司正忙，离不了你。</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a medium shot of the office door as <Subject 3>, 花果果 (Hua Guo Guo) from <Picture 3> with the exact appearance of the reference image, steps in holding two shopping bags and asks in a light, casual voice (S3): <d>[Chinese] 宝宝，明天陪我去逛街呗。</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the shot cuts to a close-up of 旭旭宝宝's face, which instantly transforms from stern to beaming; he jumps up from the chair and says with exaggerated enthusiasm (S2): <d>[Chinese] 去去去，必须去！那什么——明天全公司放假！李永，你也放假！</d> The camera pulls out slightly to a medium shot as 李永 slowly turns his head toward the camera.\n[Shot 4] At 00:10.000, the shot cuts to an extreme close-up of 李永's face, completely blank and still, as he says in a flat, hollow voice (S1): <d>[Chinese] ……那我刚才请的是个寂寞？</d>\n[Shot 5] At 00:12.500, the shot cuts to a medium shot: 花果果 smiles sweetly, 旭旭宝宝 grins with both thumbs up, and 李永 stands frozen between them with a deadpan expression, holding his leave request paper. The shot freezes at the 15.00-second mark.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nBright office room tone with faint keyboard clacks and a low air-conditioning hum. A pen clicks on the desk, footsteps cross the room, the office chair creaks, and shopping bags rustle as 花果果 steps in. A comedic record scratch lands the instant 旭旭宝宝's face changes, followed by a beat of dead silence before the final rimshot.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA light comedic track with pizzicato strings and a soft bass groove starts under the conversation. When 花果果 enters, a single dramatic sting hits; the music drops out completely during 李永's deadpan line and ends with one comedic rimshot on the final freeze frame."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1481.8245849609375, 6025.5439453125], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [864.9073486328125, 798.9801025390625], "pos": [550.353759765625, 5707.53271484375], "widgets_values": [24, "video/ComfyUI", false], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 295, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio", "link": 296, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "fps"}, "name": "fps", "label": "fps", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "fps"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "only_preview"}, "name": "only_preview", "label": "only_preview", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "only_preview"}], "flags": {}, "id": 148, "type": "SaveVideoRGBA", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveVideoRGBA"}, "order": 27}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [295, 300, 301, 304], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [230, 60], "pos": [507.03781